# What's new in SUSpector, shown in its update dialog and on the download page.
# A line with a version starts its section, then one "- " line per change. tools\build-suspector-release.ps1
# takes the section of the version it builds and stops when there is none: write it when raising the version.

2026.11.21.2
- feat: document search (button at the bottom, Ctrl+F) finds a lost work file by its name or text, on all disks or one of them, a flash drive too
- feat: the check can be stopped (button or Esc); the result line is at the bottom, next to the buttons
- feat: tables as in SupraWeed: drag the edge of a column to widen it, drag a column to move it; columns that do not fit scroll sideways
- fix: a wrong computer name or domain says to contact the system administrator
- style: the search window has the dark title bar in the dark theme
2026.11.13.1
- feat: security check tags, bulk delete by tag and side-by-side tables
- feat: SupraWeed files are locked against deletion
- feat: language and theme move into «О программе»
- feat: downloads and updates go through chagear.top
- style: coloured part of the program name, as on chagear.top
- style: bigger table layout switch, as tall as the run button
